	(text "AmpBank — 10 socketed op amp channels, one selected at a time.\nInput AND output are switched; supply is always on (see AGENT_HANDOFF 2.9).\nGAIN = 1 + Rf/Rg : 0R=1.0  10k=1.5  20k=2.0(default)  39k=3.0  62k=4.1  82k=5.1  180k=10.0"
